===1948 to present===
Manitoba is currently one of five provinces where decals are not used to show that the vehicle has valid registration.<ref>The other four provinces are Alberta, British Columbia, Saskatchewan, and Quebec.</ref><ref>{{cite web |title=Manitoba Public Insurance scrapping licence plate stickers |url=https://www.cbc.ca/news/canada/manitoba/manitoba-public-insurance-scrapping-licence-plate-stickers-1.3405512 |publisher=[[CBC News]] |date=January 15, 2016 |access-date=June 27, 2016}}</ref>

