==Vanity plates==
The province also offers personalized vanity license plates, at a cost of $100. These plates can be affixed to passenger vehicles, non-commercial trucks, farm trucks, motorcycles, mopeds and motorhomes.<ref>{{cite web |title=Personalized licence plates |url=https://www.mpi.mb.ca/Pages/personalized-plates.aspx |website=Manitoba Public Insurance |access-date=7 September 2022}}</ref>
